@section styles {
    <style>
        .terms-section-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-color, #6366f1); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .terms-item { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .terms-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    </style>
}

<!-- Page Header -->
<div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between page-header-breadcrumb flex-wrap gap-2">
    <div>
        <nav>
            <ol class="breadcrumb mb-1">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="javascript:void(0);">Legal</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Refund Policy</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="page-title fw-medium fs-18 mb-0">Refund Policy</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap fs-12">
        <a href="/terms-conditions" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/privacy-policy" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/refund-policy" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Refund Policy</a>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Page Header Close -->

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-xl-9">

        <div class="card custom-card mb-3">
            <div class="card-body p-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                <i class="ri-refund-2-line text-primary fs-22"></i>
                <div>
                    <div class="fw-semibold fs-14">Last updated: June 2025</div>
                    <div class="text-muted fs-12">This policy outlines when and how refunds are issued for AutoSignals subscriptions.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card custom-card overflow-hidden">
            <div class="card-body p-4">

                <div class="mb-4 text-center">
                    <h3 class="mb-1 text-primary">Refund Policy</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted fs-13">AutoSignals — Crypto Signal Analytics Platform</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Overview -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">Overview</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                    <li class="terms-item">
                        <p class="mb-0 fs-14">AutoSignals subscriptions are digital products delivered immediately upon purchase. All payments are processed by <strong>Lemon Squeezy</strong> (our merchant of record). Because you receive instant access to paid features upon subscribing, our refund policy is as follows.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 1. Free Trial -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">1. 30-Day Free Trial</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                    <li class="terms-item">
                        <p class="mb-0 fs-14">Every new account automatically receives a <strong>30-day Pro tier trial at no cost</strong>. No credit card is required. No charge is made unless you actively subscribe. You can explore the full Pro feature set and cancel or let the trial expire — either way you will not be charged.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 2. 7-Day Money-Back Guarantee -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">2. 7-Day Money-Back Guarantee (First Purchase)</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                    <li class="terms-item">
                        <p class="mb-0 fs-14">If you subscribe for the first time and are not satisfied for any reason, you may request a <strong>full refund within 7 days</strong> of your first payment. To request a refund, contact us through the platform's support channel or reply to your Lemon Squeezy purchase receipt email. Refunds are processed within 5–10 business days depending on your payment method.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 3. Renewals -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">3. Subscription Renewals</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                    <li class="terms-item">
                        <p class="mb-0 fs-14">Renewal charges are not eligible for a refund once the new billing period has started, except where required by applicable consumer protection law. To avoid an unwanted renewal, cancel your subscription <strong>before</strong> your next billing date. You can cancel at any time in your account settings — access continues until the end of the paid period.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 4. Annual Plans -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">4. Annual Plans</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                    <li class="terms-item">
                        <p class="mb-0 fs-14">Annual subscriptions are eligible for the same 7-day money-back guarantee on the first purchase. After 7 days, annual plans are non-refundable on a pro-rata basis. However, you may cancel at any time and retain access until the annual period expires.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 5. Exceptions -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">5. Exceptions — When We Always Refund</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                    <li class="terms-item fs-14">We will always issue a refund if: (a) you were charged after cancelling before the renewal date due to a system error; (b) the Service was completely unavailable for more than 72 consecutive hours during your billing period; or (c) required by applicable consumer protection law in your jurisdiction.</li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 6. How to Request -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">6. How to Request a Refund</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                    <li class="terms-item">
                        <p class="mb-2 fs-14">To request a refund:</p>
                        <ol class="fs-14">
                            <li>Email <a href="mailto:refunds@autosignals.xyz" class="text-primary fw-medium">refunds@autosignals.xyz</a> or use the platform's in-app support.</li>
                            <li>Include your registered email address and the reason for the refund request.</li>
                            <li>We will respond within 2 business days and process approved refunds through Lemon Squeezy.</li>
                        </ol>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 7. Contact -->
                <h6 class="terms-section-title">7. Contact</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-2">
                    <li class="terms-item fs-14">For billing questions or refund requests, email <a href="mailto:refunds@autosignals.xyz" class="text-primary fw-medium">refunds@autosignals.xyz</a>. We aim to respond within 2 business days.</li>
                </ul>

            </div>
            <div class="card-footer py-3 text-center">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-4 flex-wrap fs-13">
                    <a href="/terms-conditions" class="text-muted">Terms of Service</a>
                    <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-muted">Privacy Policy</a>
                    <a href="/refund-policy" class="text-primary fw-medium">Refund Policy</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

